#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:4
msgid "Quickstart"
msgstr "快速上手"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:6
msgid ""
"This page walks you through your first federated training run with fl-"
"sim: install the package, train :class:`~fl_sim.algorithms.fedopt.FedAvg`"
" on a synthetic dataset, and look at the logs it produces. The whole run "
"takes seconds on a laptop — no dataset download, no GPU required."
msgstr ""
"本页面带你完成第一次联邦训练：安装 fl-sim，在合成数据集上训练 "
":class:`~fl_sim.algorithms.fedopt.FedAvg`，并查看产出的日志。整个过程在笔记本电脑上"
"几秒即可完成——无需下载数据集，也无需 GPU。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:11
msgid ""
"If you prefer understanding the concepts first, read :doc:`concepts` and "
"come back."
msgstr "如果你更愿意先了解概念，可以先阅读 :doc:`concepts` 再回来。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:15
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "准备条件"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:17
msgid ""
"Install fl-sim following :doc:`install` (``pip install "
"git+https://github.com/wenh06/fl-sim.git``). Python 3.10+ with PyTorch is"
" all you need."
msgstr ""
"按照 :doc:`install` 安装 fl-sim（``pip install "
"git+https://github.com/wenh06/fl-sim.git``）。只需 Python 3.10+ 与 PyTorch。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:21
msgid "Train your first model"
msgstr "训练第一个模型"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:23
msgid ""
"Every federated run in fl-sim is built from three objects: a **dataset** "
"(the data plus how it is split across clients), a **model** (a PyTorch "
"module, here taken from the dataset's built-in candidates), and a "
"**server** (which owns the global model, samples clients, and "
"aggregates). The server config carries the federated schedule (rounds, "
"client count, sampling ratio); the client config carries the local "
"training recipe."
msgstr ""
"fl-sim 中的每次联邦训练都由三个对象构成： **数据集** （数据本身以及在客户端之间的"
"划分方式）、 **模型** （一个 PyTorch 模块，这里取自数据集内置的候选模型）和"
" **服务器** （持有全局模型，负责采样客户端与聚合）。服务器配置承载联邦训练的调度"
"（轮数、客户端数量、采样比例）；客户端配置承载本地训练方案。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:35
msgid ""
"Paste this into a script (or a REPL) and run it. ``FedSynthetic`` "
"generates a synthetic classification dataset split across 30 clients — "
"nothing is downloaded. ``FedAvgServerConfig(num_iters=5, num_clients=10, "
"clients_sample_ratio=1.0)`` runs **5 rounds**, each sampling **10 of the "
"30 clients** with all of them responding. ``server.train()`` runs the "
"full federated loop; you will see per-round progress and metrics in the "
"console."
msgstr ""
"把这段代码粘贴到脚本（或 REPL）里运行。``FedSynthetic`` 会在本地生成一个划分给 "
"30 个客户端的合成分类数据集——不下载任何东西。"
"``FedAvgServerConfig(num_iters=5, num_clients=10, clients_sample_ratio=1.0)`` "
"运行 **5 轮**，每轮从 30 个客户端中采样 **10 个**，且全部参与。"
"``server.train()`` 运行完整的联邦循环；你会在控制台看到每轮的进度与指标。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:44
msgid ""
"``server.train()`` is ``server.train(\"federated\")``. fl-sim can also "
"run ``\"centralized\"`` and ``\"local\"`` baselines with the same objects"
" — see the :meth:`~fl_sim.nodes.Server.train` API."
msgstr ""
"``server.train()`` 即 ``server.train(\"federated\")``。fl-sim 也可以用同样的对象运行 "
"``\"centralized\"`` 与 ``\"local\"`` 基线——参见 :meth:`~fl_sim.nodes.Server.train` API。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:49
msgid "Where do the logs go?"
msgstr "日志在哪里？"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:51
msgid ""
"Every run writes its logs to ``~/.cache/fl-sim/.logs/`` (override the "
"subdirectory with ``log_dir=`` in the server config, as done here). The "
"script above reads the metrics back and prints the result:"
msgstr ""
"每次运行都会把日志写入 ``~/.cache/fl-sim/.logs/`` （可通过服务器配置里的 "
"``log_dir=`` 指定子目录，如本例所示）。上面的脚本会把指标读回来并打印结果："

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:62
msgid "Three files per run:"
msgstr "每次运行产生三个文件："

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:64
msgid "a ``.txt`` log with the human-readable console history;"
msgstr "一个 ``.txt`` 日志，保存人类可读的控制台历史；"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:65
msgid ""
"a ``.json`` log with the full metrics history, structured as "
"``{\"train\": {...}, \"val\": {\"Server\": [...], \"Client0\": [...], "
"...}}`` — one dict per evaluation, holding ``step``, ``acc``, ``loss``, "
"etc. This is the file you will plot when visualizing results;"
msgstr ""
"一个 ``.json`` 日志，保存完整的指标历史，结构为 "
"``{\"train\": {...}, \"val\": {\"Server\": [...], \"Client0\": [...], "
"...}}``——每次评估对应一个字典，包含 ``step``、``acc``、``loss`` 等字段。"
"可视化结果时用的就是这个文件；"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:69
msgid ""
"``config.json`` — the exact server and client configs of the run, so "
"every experiment can be reproduced later."
msgstr ""
"``config.json``——本次运行的确切服务器与客户端配置，便于日后复现每个实验。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:74
msgid ""
"The ``step`` in the logs counts **communications**, not rounds: each "
"round adds one downlink broadcast plus one uplink reply per sampled "
"client (10 sampled clients → step advances by 20 per round here). The "
"json snapshot is taken at the start of each round, so the final "
"communication count is higher than the last logged step."
msgstr ""
"日志中的 ``step`` 统计的是**通信次数**，而不是轮数：每轮对每个被采样客户端包含一次"
"下行广播与一次上行回复（这里每轮采样 10 个客户端，因此 step 每轮前进 20）。json "
"中的快照记录于每轮开始时，因此最终通信次数会大于最后一条日志的 step。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:80
msgid ""
"(The exact accuracy value may differ across machines and package "
"versions; on one machine this run ends at 0.8767, up from 0.16 at "
"initialization.)"
msgstr ""
"（具体精度数值可能因机器与包版本而异；在一种机器上，该运行的最终精度为 0.8767，"
"初始时为 0.16。）"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:84
msgid "Next steps"
msgstr "下一步"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:86
msgid ""
":doc:`concepts` — what actually happens in each round: sampling, "
"broadcast, local updates, aggregation."
msgstr ":doc:`concepts`——每一轮实际发生了什么：采样、广播、本地更新、聚合。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:88
msgid ""
":doc:`cli` — run experiments from the command line with YAML config files"
" (a full tutorial on experiment batches is on the way)."
msgstr ""
":doc:`cli`——用 YAML 配置文件从命令行运行实验（关于实验批次的完整教程也在准备中）。"

#: ../../source/quickstart.rst:90
msgid ""
":doc:`parallel_execution` — speed training up with a parallel executor "
"backend while keeping results reproducible."
msgstr ""
":doc:`parallel_execution`——用并行执行后端加速训练，同时保持结果可复现。"
